  <item>
    <title>17. 为啤酒去定义, 你会喝可乐喝到吐吗?</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67050d306c7f8177868abb0e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67050d306c7f8177868abb0e</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 10:45:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>又见面啦,这一次D老师和米老板邀请了新嘉宾 -大头, 浅聊一下啤酒, 你会喝可乐喝到吐吗？为什么我们总是给酒赋予这么多意义?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 欢迎嘉宾大头.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 对啤酒的一个初印象.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a> 工业啤酒和精酿啤酒的区别.</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 你会喝可乐喝到吐吗?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a>: 啤酒的来源</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1013">16:53</a> 啤酒的种类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 反矫情, 去意义化的去喝喜欢的饮料</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 科罗娜的柠檬是为了堵住苍蝇?!</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">39:54</a> 在悉尼喝酒去哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2586">43:06</a> 建议大家在安全的环境里, 先自己探探底</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltzivTbD2b3q2sYN-OJq9fImCFKo.m4a" length="49983035" type="audio/mp4"/>
