  <item>
    <title>8. 出国多年都不敢随意说英语｜你的面子到底值多少钱？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/650fe31dbbe351e616bd1332</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">650fe31dbbe351e616bd1332</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 24 Sep 2023 07:19:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是由胡说八道的D老师和一本正经的米老板一起带来的第八期节目。本期想和大家聊聊我们日常生活中因为“完美主义”和面子所遇到的阻碍，揭开面子的面纱，聊一聊突破面子那一刻的趣事，炸开的奶昔和作为普通人的觉悟。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a>】我们认为的完美主义，是真的完美主义吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="303">05:03</a>】对“不完美”的恐惧，给自己设定的完美人设。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a>】留学生常遇到的英语和口音问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1031">17:11</a>】不会为小事尴尬的朋友，让人感觉如沐春风。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1156">19:16</a>】“完美主义”是“面子问题”的遮羞布。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1342">22:22</a>】别太把自己当回事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a>】D老师突破面子的那一刻之炸开的奶昔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1609">26:49</a>】怎么区分面子和自尊呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a>】放轻松，和不完美的自己和解。</span></p>]]></description>
